    {
      "text": "A teenager calculated the ideal diamond cut.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook",
        "show": "gem",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#eef4f7",
        "color": "#5bb4e8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Marcel Tolkowsky came from a family of Antwerp diamond cutters,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "study",
        "name": "Marcel Tolkowsky",
        "role": "Antwerp",
        "color": "#4cc3a8",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "suit",
            "outfitColor": "#2a3f5d",
            "hair": "side",
            "hairColor": "#3a2a1e",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "focused"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "but he trained as an engineer.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "study",
        "name": "Marcel Tolkowsky",
        "role": "An engineer",
        "color": "#f7c23a",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#e8e2d2",
            "hair": "side",
            "hairColor": "#3a2a1e",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "smile",
            "prop": "magnifier"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1919, at age 19, he published Diamond Design in London.",
      "say": "In nineteen nineteen, at age nineteen, he published Diamond Design in London.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Diamond Design",
        "sub": "London, 1919",
        "color": "#ec6a9c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It worked out how light reflects and bends inside a diamond.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "gem",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#eef4f7",
        "label": "Light inside",
        "light": "#fff2c4",
        "color": "#a98be0"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He wanted the proportions that give a stone the most brilliance.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "jewel",
        "piece": "ring",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#eef4f7",
        "metal": "white",
        "prongs": 6,
        "label": "Proportions",
        "velvet": "#5bb4e8",
        "color": "#f0552e"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His ideal table is 53 percent as wide as the stone.",
      "say": "His ideal table is fifty-three percent as wide as the stone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "53%",
        "sub": "Table width",
        "color": "#c8dc3c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The top slopes at 34.5 degrees and the bottom at 40.75.",
      "say": "The top slopes at thirty-four point five degrees and the bottom at forty point seven five.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "34.5° and 40.75°",
        "sub": "Top and bottom slopes",
        "color": "#4cc3a8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The modern round brilliant has 58 facets.",
      "say": "The modern round brilliant has fifty-eight facets.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "58 facets",
        "sub": "Round brilliant",
        "color": "#f7c23a"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jewelers still call it the Tolkowsky cut.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "gift",
        "stone": "gem",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#eef4f7",
        "to": "The Tolkowsky cut",
        "date": "1919",
        "color": "#ec6a9c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It became the benchmark for cutting round diamonds.",
